              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Elizabeth Lombard"
            },
            "reviewBody": "THIS Ricotta pie was the perfect dessert after a roasted lamb dinner on Easter Sunday. The pie was light and airy. I used frozen strawberries as an optional topping. This is perfect if you love a traditional dessert but don't want something as heavy as cheesecake. I will keep this in my \"active file.\". Thank you, Linda C for terrific recipe."
