              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "angelyogadiva"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this in little ramekin dishes (8) and baked the same amount of time. the crust added a lot of calories so I omitted. I like not so sweet desserts so this was really good for me. if you are into really rich desserts this is not for you. I also substituted eggbeaters for the eggs. enjoy!",
