            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this to use up some ricotta cheese &amp; I will be making it again for sure. I didn't use any crust as I can't have wheat but it was still easy to dish out. I sprinkled cinnamon on a plate outlining a fork then placed the pie topped with a drizzle of chocolate sauce &amp; sour cherries. My husband loved it &amp; this will be one of my go to recipes for guests &amp; for just because days. A nice light not too sweet treat.",
